OL,3,GNEWSACouncil votes to axe two hour free
OL,4,Aparking scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme offering people two hours of
OL,7,Ffree parking in Wakefield has been
OL,8,Fscrapped after the council said it was
OL,9,F"unaffordable".
OL,11,FThe discount, which applied at
OL,12,Foff-street car parks, was reintroduced
OL,13,Fby Labour in November 2025, in an
OL,14,Feffort to increase footfall on the
OL,15,Fborough's high streets.
OL,17,FHowever, the now Reform UK-led council
OL,18,Fvoted to ditch the scheme at a meeting
OL,19,Fon Tuesday in favour of bringing back
OL,20,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
