OL,3,GNEWSACouncil votes to axe two hour free
OL,4,Aparking scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Keith Anderson, who holds
OL,7,Fresponsibility for highways, transport
OL,8,Fand planning, said the offer cost the
OL,9,Fcouncil #1.8m a year, adding that there
OL,10,Fhad been "no increase in footfall"
OL,11,Fwhile it was in place.
